Third-party content included in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Apache-2.0 grant covers this project's own work: the source code, the
generated test corpora, the documentation. It does not, and cannot, cover
material published by someone else that is carried here unmodified.

  src/corpus/data/real/bosch-geschaeftsbericht-2025.pdf

    A genuine, publicly published Bosch annual report. Copyright remains with
    its publisher; it is neither authored nor licensed by this project, and
    the Apache-2.0 grant above does not extend to it.

    Why it is here: the project's fixture specification requires at least one
    real published document, on the reasoning that a generator only ever
    produces the traps its author already thought of. This file is read
    end-to-end by four acceptance tests to prove the document pipeline
    survives a real page — typeset in InDesign, encrypted, bilingual, 146
    pages. No content is extracted, republished or presented as this
    project's own.

    Anyone redistributing this repository should form their own view on
    whether carrying that file is appropriate for their purpose. Replacing it
    with another real public report, or fetching it on demand instead of
    committing it, are both open options — see meta/memory.md.

Everything else under src/corpus/data/ and corpora/ is generated by this
project's own corpus generators and is fictional. Company names, people,
vessels, VAT numbers, e-mail addresses and bank details in those files do not
refer to real entities; `scripts/publication-scan.py` checks that claim on
every build.
